#. module: theme_yes
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_yes.s_split_intro
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<br/>Let us turn your vision into a stunning reality. As your dedicated "
"wedding planner, we handle every detail with care and creativity, from venue "
"selection to final touches. Whether you envision an intimate ceremony or a "
"grand celebration, we ensure your special day is seamless, beautiful, and "
"unforgettable.<br/><br/>"
msgstr ""
"<br/>Naj vašo vizijo spremenimo v osupljivo resničnost. Kot vaš predani "
"organizator poroke bomo z veliko skrbnostjo in ustvarjalnostjo poskrbeli za "
"vsako podrobnost, od izbire lokacije do zadnjih poudarkov. Ne glede na to, "
"ali si želite intimnega obreda ali veličastnega praznovanja, bomo poskrbeli, "
"da bo vaš posebni dan potekal brezhibno, bil čudovit in nepozaben.<br/><br/>"

#. module: theme_yes
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_yes.s_text_cover
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<br/>Organize and showcase your wedding services with a user-friendly "
"platform that simplifies everything, from setup to event management, making "
"it easy for couples to discover and choose the perfect details for their big "
"day<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<br/>Organizirajte in predstavite svoje poročne storitve z uporabniku "
"prijazno platformo, ki poenostavi vse, od priprav do upravljanja dogodka, "
"ter parom olajša odkrivanje in izbiro popolnih podrobnosti za njun veliki "
"dan<br/>"

#. module: theme_yes
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_yes.s_empowerment
#, fuzzy
